        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: पञ्चमः",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पञ्चमः (pañcamaḥ) — \"fifth\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "You have counted एक द्व त्रि चतुर् पञ्च since chapter six. Those words answer how many. This one answers which one in the line, and Sanskrit keeps a second set of words for that job."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "An ordinal is an ordinary adjective, so it wears the endings you already know: पञ्चमः (pañcamaḥ) for a masculine thing, पञ्चमम् for a neuter one."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पञ्च + म."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The number is not worn down and not replaced. It stands there whole, and a single syllable goes on the end."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Macdonell's dictionary prints the word with the join marked — pañca-má — and it will print four more the same way before this chapter is out."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "This lesson does not begin at first. It begins at fifth because -म is the ending that WORKS, and a rule has to be visible before anything can be seen departing from it. The words for first, second and third all depart from it, and they wait."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One ordinal, and the ending that will make the next four for free."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 1,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 1s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
